  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man orf befo, ⁊ man ofer stream hit tyman wylle, ðonne sette man inborh oððe underwed lecge, þæt seo sprec ende hæbbe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone seizes cattle, and a man [the owner] across the river-border wants [to claim] them by vouching to warranty, then security or pledge is [to be] set, so that the case [may proceed and so] have an outcome.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si pecus intercietur, et ultra flumen aduocetur, tunc ponatur inborh uel underþed mittatur, ut placitum illud finem habeat.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
